    {
      "sheet": "special_motion_expanded.png",
      "generator": "built-in image_gen",
      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Production sprite animation expansion for original hand-drawn 2D dark fantasy insect game. Reference images are identity and style references only, NOT desired grid or background. Preserve exact character identity, proportions, costume, palette, clean ink and painterly material textures. Pure side view all living frames facing RIGHT. Transparent real alpha background, no backdrop, ground, shadows, labels, text, borders, particles, panels. Each equal cell contains exactly one COMPLETE character including every antenna, blade and robe, with ample transparent gutter. Fixed body scale and centered pelvis, grounded foot baseline at 90% cell height. Distinct redrawn poses with real limb and weapon articulation, never stamp, shift or rotate a whole copy. Character: Moss Bell Matriarch as reference. Ivory mantis mask, bell-hung branch antennae, great bronze bell torso, flowering moss root robe, two ivory root-scythe forearms. Exactly 4 COLUMNS and 6 ROWS = 24 separate sprites, tall canvas, WIDE TRANSPARENT GUTTERS at least 8% of each cell all around each whole sprite, body smaller to fit both scythes. Six animation sequences, each ROW is one sequence of four in-between poses: row1 HEAVY WINDUP arms gradually lift scythes overhead and knees coil; row2 HEAVY 4 overhead slam progression down through ground contact then rising return, both blades complete; row3 CAST WINDUP left scythe curves inwards and torso inclines, bells shake; row4 CAST fully opens scythe arms, bell torso tilts and ringing pose settles, no separate effects; row5 PHASE WINDUP crouches, moss robe gathers, head inclines then coiled rising; row6 PHASE opens robe root silhouette into imposing full-body stance, scythes extend then settle. All living forms facing RIGHT. Real anatomical articulation across each four-frame sequence, never exact copied poses. No scene, no floor, no shadow, no words or labels. Real fully transparent background.",
